Guyana,GUY,Must the cyber operation have a coercive character (or effect) to qualify as a use of force?,Silent,,,,
Guyana,GUY,Does the State apply a “scale and effects” test to assess whether an action constitutes a use of force?,Silent,,,,
Guyana,GUY,Does the State apply a totality of circumstances or similar context-based test to assess uses of force?,Silent,,,,
Guyana,GUY,Does the State weigh the actual consequences of an action to assess whether it amounts to a use of force?,Silent,,,,
Guyana,GUY,"Does the State only recognize a use of force in cyber contexts by analogy to consequences caused by kinetic force (e.g., injury, death, damage or destruction)?",Silent,,,,
