Italy,ITA,Can a cyber operation amount to a prohibited threat of a use of force?,Silent,,,,
Japan,JPN,Does the prohibition of use of force apply to cyber operations?,Yes,"Under certain circumstances, a cyber operation may constitute the threat or use of force prohibited by Article 2(4) of the UN Charter. Pursuant to this article, all States shall refrain in their international relations from the threat or use of force. (Basic p.6)","Japan Statement (2021) pg. 6, 5(b)",,
